# Smoke test for the AI-core inference primitive (llm_load/.generate).
# Run with:
#   cargo run -p qu-cli --features llm -- run engine/examples/llm_smoke_test.qu
#
# First run downloads TinyLlama-1.1B-Chat (Q4_K_M GGUF, ~669MB) plus its
# tokenizer.json into the local Hugging Face cache; later runs reuse the
# cached files and only pay real model-load + CPU-inference time.
m = llm_load("tinyllama")
print(m.name)
out = m.generate("The capital of France is", 12)
print(out)
